  "summary_md": "**Matsby ([@goldenagemoy](https://x.com/goldenagemoy/status/2115758035213930575))** releases **SnipToss 1.0**, an MIT Windows 11 app for reviewing agent output: annotate images and videos with pins, boxes and timed comments, capture screen regions, and hand notes back via .sniptoss/REVIEW.md for Claude Code or Codex, or as images for web chat apps; no account or telemetry, Mac version in progress ([Moy339339/SnipToss](https://github.com/Moy339339/SnipToss)).",
